<!--
  Small icon for the cardioplegia reminder notification.

  Android requires the notification SMALL icon to be a flat, monochrome
  (white-on-transparent) drawable. Passing an adaptive launcher icon
  (@mipmap/ic_launcher) instead is a well-known source of
  "Bad notification posted ... Couldn't create icon" crashes, especially
  when the notification is posted from a broadcast receiver rather than
  from the foreground app - which matches a crash that only happens for
  SCHEDULED notifications while the immediate test notification works.
-->
